"posts":{"i":[{"x":"Refueling with @lindsay4iowa.bsky.social","w":"Cait Conley","wk":"candidate","pf":"bluesky","t":"2026-11-10T03:44:54Z","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:2ptvpgdvmn326rt3nl6rjlmv/post/3mzwjngewak2x"},{"x":"It’s time for Congress to focus on the next generation, not the next election. That means putting country over party to deliver real results — from rooting out corruption to lowering costs. When it comes to delivering for Hudson Valley families, nothing will stand in my way.","w":"Cait Conley","wk":"candidate","pf":"bluesky","t":"2026-11-09T22:03:52Z","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:2ptvpgdvmn326rt3nl6rjlmv/post/3mzvwlm5rs22y"},{"x":"What an awesome night celebrating — and briefly participating in :) — Rockland Fashion Week! Huge shoutout to Hope Wade Designs for an amazing fashion show and her incredible leadership. Next time you’re in Nyack, make sure to check out her shop!","w":"Cait Conley","wk":"candidate","pf":"bluesky","t":"2026-11-09T18:11:50Z","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:2ptvpgdvmn326rt3nl6rjlmv/post/3mzvjmp4idk2c"},{"x":"Reporting for duty. Let’s get to work!","w":"Cait Conley","wk":"candidate","pf":"bluesky","t":"2026-11-09T14:19:19Z","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:2ptvpgdvmn326rt3nl6rjlmv/post/3mzv4mxc35k2b"},{"x":"Happy Diwali to all those who celebrate! Wishing you a wonderful festival of lights.","w":"Cait Conley","wk":"candidate","pf":"bluesky","t":"2026-11-09T01:45:08Z","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:2ptvpgdvmn326rt3nl6rjlmv/post/3mztsidvh4s26"},{"x":"🚨 We’re hiring! If you’re interested in serving the Hudson Valley in Congresswoman-elect Cait Conley’s NY or DC offices, please submit your resume below. docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1F...","w":"Cait Conley","wk":"candidate","pf":"bluesky","t":"2026-11-08T23:49:10Z","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:2ptvpgdvmn326rt3nl6rjlmv/post/3mztlyy3evs26"},{"x":"Hudson Valley voters made clear this election that they want Washington to work for working people. I’m determined to deliver on that.","w":"Cait Conley","wk":"candidate","pf":"bluesky","t":"2026-11-08T22:43:44Z","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:2ptvpgdvmn326rt3nl6rjlmv/post/3mztidyses226"},{"x":"It was an honor to attend the Town of Clarkstown’s annual Veterans Appreciation Lunch on Friday.","w":"Cait Conley","wk":"candidate","pf":"bluesky","t":"2026-11-08T15:40:54Z","u":"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:2ptvpgdvmn326rt3nl6rjlmv/post/3mzsqpvrfu22o"}],"more":11},"ck":"2026-11-08"}